  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "Given that the ratio of \\(3x-4\\) to \\(y+15\\) is constant, and \\(y=3\\) when \\(x=2,\\) then, when \\(y=12,\\) \\(x\\) equals:",
  "answerChoices": [
